 ('Reading · A news report',news('County Board Votes to Add Philosophy to Middle-School Curriculum',['The Maplewood County Board of Education **voted 5–2** on Wednesday to **introduce** a year-long philosophy course for **eighth graders** from next autumn. **Proponents** say the course will **sharpen reasoning**; **opponents**, who **cited** budget pressures, **warned** it would **crowd out** the arts.','Superintendent Carla Dunn **told the board** that a pilot in two schools had **yielded** “markedly better” classroom discussion, **though** she **conceded** the sample was small. **Teachers will receive** a stipend for training. **The measure takes effect** in September, **subject to** final budget approval. (Fictional report.)'],kicker='EDUCATION NEWS',by='By staff (fictional)',gloss=[('proponent','defensor'),('crowd out','excluir por falta de espaço'),('stipend','bolsa, auxílio'),('pilot','projeto-piloto')])),
